:: Felix Hang Out End Late Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you are trying to think about what to do next, you suddenly feel <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> tap you on the shoulder. Even before you see his expression, you know what he’s going to say. With the sun going down it was only a matter of time, <span style="color:LightCoral">but his attempt of a forced smile makes it worse.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
