<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, I’ve had fun but… I really have to be going home. Host family has a strict curfew.”</span> He tries his best to sound genuine, but you get the feeling he has been pretty bored during your hangout and is quite happy to use this curfew as an excuse to leave. You thank him for hanging out, not wanting to make this any more awkward than it is <span style="color:LightCoral">and already feeling bad for failing to entertain your friend. You both then share an even more awkward wave and begin walking off in different directions.</span> <br>
